>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYCAP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 BALANCE-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 RESERVED-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 TOTAL-DEBIT-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 BALANCE-CENTS PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 TOTAL-DEBIT-CENTS PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 OUTPUT-CODE PIC X(32).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO BALANCE-TEXT RESERVED-TEXT TOTAL-DEBIT-TEXT
    END-UNSTRING
    COMPUTE BALANCE-CENTS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(BALANCE-TEXT)
    COMPUTE TOTAL-DEBIT-CENTS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(TOTAL-DEBIT-TEXT)
    IF BALANCE-CENTS >= TOTAL-DEBIT-CENTS
        MOVE "CAPACITY_OK" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    ELSE
        MOVE "INSUFFICIENT_CAPACITY" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
